WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2530517Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2632154Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2644020Z ^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2644708Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2645576Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2645952Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2646151Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2647171Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2647450Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2647629Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2648163Z    if you are ready to continue.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2648468Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2649078Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2650052Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2650857Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2651369Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2651538Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2651705Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2651963Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2652150Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2652501Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2652636Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2652732Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2652876Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2653187Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2653622Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2659235Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2659404Z I will:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2659677Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2659991Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2660643Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2661324Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2661968Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2662401Z  - install Nix in /nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2662812Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2663367Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2663762Z    /root
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2674701Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2676039Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2687013Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2687587Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:31:50.2688057Z 
