API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:32:41.5805481Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-11T14:32:41.5806140Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
